  <item>
    <title>EP016｜移民系列：加拿大移民体系下的各种法语项目</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670ca7770d2f24f289eeee50</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670ca7770d2f24f289eeee50</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Oct 2024 05:09:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期从加拿大的联邦和省这两个层面介绍经济类移民体系下的各种法语移民项目。如果观众和听众需要咨询法语类移民的具体问题，可以在</span><a href="https://gniu.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/EP016-Francophone-Immigration.pdf" data-url="https://gniu.ca/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/EP016-Francophone-Immigration.pdf"><span>课件</span></a><span>中找到我的联系方式。</span><br><span> </span><br><span>时间戳：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> 开场白</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 法语移民的法理基础</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="776">12:56</a> IRCC的法语移民项目和优惠政策</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> 法语社区移民试点</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="908">15:08</a> 快速通道的法语水平类别</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1060">17:40</a> 快速通道的CRS法语加分</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1257">20:57</a> C16法语流动封闭式工签</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1825">30:25</a> 各省的法语移民项目和优惠政策</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1933">32:13</a> 安大略OINP：ONEE法语技术工人通道</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2059">34:19</a> 新不伦瑞克NBPNP：法语战略举措通道</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2286">38:06</a> 西北领地NTNP：法语通道</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2392">39:52</a> 新斯科舍NSNP：NSEE劳动市场优先类</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2471">41:11</a> 艾伯塔AAIP：ABEE</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2638">43:58</a> 曼尼托巴MPNP：SWO</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2762">46:02</a> 所有省份针对法语的共有政策</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2980">49:40</a> 加拿大接受的法语考试类型：TEF vs. TCF</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3183">53:03</a> 欧标如何对应到NCLC</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3335">55:35</a> 什么样的人适合自学法语？</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrzR9XBb9d3uFpW29lkqIHe850EM.m4a" length="47487899" type="audio/mp4"/>
