    <guid isPermaLink="false">65cb2620dde969cfdc9481c6</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 13 Feb 2024 08:19:42 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目有配套视频，牛顿向大家实践展示如何在CanLII上进行法律文献尤其是判例法的检索阅读操作。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场白</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> Canlii数据库简介</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="267">04:27</a> 方式一：通过关键字组合操作检索</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1536">25:36</a> 方式二：通过判例法名称或引用标识检索</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2323">38:43</a> 方式三：通过noteup（追踪引用）检索</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3790">1:03:10</a> 经常阅读判决文书，益处多多</span><br><span></span><br><span>CanLII网址：</span><a href="https://www.canlii.org/" data-url="https://www.canlii.org/"><span>www.canlii.org</span></a><br><span></span></p>]]></description>
