  <item>
    <title>EP013｜和移民相关的加拿大行政与司法机构</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65c14707cace72dff893505e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65c14707cace72dff893505e</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 05 Feb 2024 20:37:26 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>延续上一期对加拿大法律的通识介绍，牛顿在本期介绍了加拿大移民事务的三个行政决策机构IRCC、CBSA、Service Canada，以及加拿大规模最大的行政审裁机构IRB下的四个处：ID、IAD、RPD、RAD，还有加拿大联邦的三级法院，并顺带介绍了履行义务令、司法复核等关键概念。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场白</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="55">00:55</a> 为什么花时间做法律通识课</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">04:21</a> 移民部（IRCC）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="304">05:04</a> 公安部（PSEPC）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="391">06:31</a> 就业部（ESDC）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="478">07:58</a> 移民和难民委员会（IRB）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="844">14:04</a> 三级联邦法院</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="861">14:21</a> 履行义务令（mandamus）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="896">14:56</a> 司法复核（judicial review）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1082">18:02</a> 判例法的约束力</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a> “合宪性”诉讼案件的司法管辖权</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1354">22:34</a> 结语</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lpEdLYsRjr5KZMj8iMolgGh_Q3g6.m4a" length="45233422" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:23:25</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cHM6Ly9pbWFnZS54eXpjZG4ubmV0L0ZtdEZQRWdnVHJnQzY3X1Q2aGxZeUxvUjdVWnIucG5n.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
