  <item>
    <title>EP012｜加拿大的法律</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64eef65ce490c5dee5ddc69a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64eef65ce490c5dee5ddc69a</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 30 Aug 2023 07:57:16 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>从本期开始，牛顿会用两期的篇幅介绍加拿大的司法，这一期先从法律通识说起。加拿大的宪法是加拿大至高无上的法律，它包括了重要的《自由与权利宪章》。加拿大的法律按照主题可以分为实体法和程序法，其中实体法分为公法与私法：公法管辖个人与国家的关系，例如行政法、刑法等；私法管辖个人之间的关系，例如侵权法、家庭法等。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场白</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="79">01:19</a> 普通法系 vs. 大陆法系</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="216">03:36</a> 加拿大的宪法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="324">05:24</a> 《权利与自由宪章》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> “宪章挑战”</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="505">08:25</a> 按照法律来源的分类</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="701">11:41</a> 按照法律主题的分类：实体法 vs. 程序法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">12:20</a> 公法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="771">12:51</a> 行政法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">13:45</a> 刑法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="930">15:30</a> 私法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> 侵权法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1216">20:16</a> 刑法 vs. 侵权法</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1461">24:21</a> 结语</span></p><span></span><p><span>勘误：<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="462">07:42</a> 处有一小段语音在编辑时被误删了。被误删的原文是：“「宪章挑战」不但给予了加拿大人强有力的法律武器来维护自己神圣不可侵犯的权益，它还确保了加拿大的法律能够持续性地一直朝着保护人权的正确方向进步发展。”</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lvIXkVp48UyBxI_rEPlWG-its7uY.m4a" length="49058299" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:25:24</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgV5XjfmRuTTKawESLd7rfJ_mrd-.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP011｜为什么你应该聘请持牌移民顾问或律师</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/644e1a9f7d934b85054e0331</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">644e1a9f7d934b85054e0331</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 30 Apr 2023 07:37:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果你聘用专业人士代表你做留学或者移民申请，并且对方提供的是付费服务，那么对方必须是持牌移民顾问或律师。在本期节目中，牛顿将为大家解释为什么持牌移民顾问或律师是必要的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场白</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="38">00:38</a> 跟进上一期的《安全第三国协议》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="130">02:10</a> 700名印度留学生因无牌顾问造假而面临遣返</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 什么是移民顾问RCIC</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="535">08:55</a> 什么是移民律师</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> 什么是高级移民顾问RCIC-IRB</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a> 为什么要请持牌顾问或律师</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1045">17:25</a> 如何验证对方的牌照资质</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 结语</span></p><span></span><p><span>相关链接：</span></p><span></span><p><span>CICC：</span><a href="https://college-ic.ca/" data-url="https://college-ic.ca/"><span>college-ic.ca</span></a><br><span>Learn about representatives：</span><a href="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigration-citizenship-representative/learn-about-representatives.html" data-url="https://www.canada.ca/en/immigration-refugees-citizenship/services/immigration-citizenship-representative/learn-about-representatives.html"><span>www.canada.ca</span></a></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lhKtsInnizpEKFSlgqYO8Li27QQH.m4a" length="41886677" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:21:41</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgV5XjfmRuTTKawESLd7rfJ_mrd-.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>EP010｜“走线”加拿大以及《安全第三国协议》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6400411bdf870a521991a6ba</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6400411bdf870a521991a6ba</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 02 Mar 2023 06:24:27 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期是《牛顿探索加拿大》第一次尝试用纯音频的方式制作节目，欢迎大家提意见。在这一期节目中，牛顿从”走线“开始谈到《安全第三国协议》给加拿大带来的大量非常规入境者的问题，以及改变现状的几种可能性。在诸多选项中，司法挑战的可行性最高。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间戳：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="22">00:22</a> 开场白</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="91">01:31</a> 从Roxham Road「走线」进入加拿大</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">06:02</a> 什么是《安全第三国协议》</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="472">07:52</a> Roxham Road的地理位置</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="589">09:49</a> 联邦议会提出的三种方案</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="831">13:51</a> 方案三：取消《安全第三国协议》的可行性</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1310">21:50</a> 结语</span></p>]]></description>
